"title": "阿摩司書 1:1–2:16",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "30001001-30002016",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p><data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"233163\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">阿摩司</data>宣講了針對<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"233080\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">北國</data>周圍列國的<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"233135\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">審判的信息</data>，這些信息以<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232805\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">詩歌</data>的形式被紀錄了下來。這些詩歌是關於<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"233035\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">大馬士革</data>的<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"233141\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">亞蘭人</data>、<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232868\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">非利士人</data>和<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"233076\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">泰爾</data>的居民，以及<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"233012\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">以東人</data>、<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"233013\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">亞捫人</data>、<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232998\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">摩押人</data>和<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"233081\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">南國</data>的居民的。這些民族的土地位於一個圓圈中，北國位於這個圓圈的中心。接著，阿摩司談到了<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232800\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">神</data>也將對北國進行<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232834\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">審判</data>。</p>",
